.TH GIT-SYNC 1 2026-09-24 git-workflow "git-workflow manual"
.SH NAME
git-sync \- fetch everything, then bring a branch up to date
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B git sync
.RI [ branch ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run
.B git fetch \-\-all \-\-prune \-\-tags
and then do what
.BR git\-rb\-pull (1)
does for
.I branch
(default: the current branch).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR git\-rb\-pull (1),
.BR git\-workflow (7)
